#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcharselect; is a tool to select special characters from all installed "
"fonts and copy them in different format (Plain text, Unicode or &HTML;) into "
"the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"&kcharselect; je alat za odabir specijalnih znakova iz svih instaliranih "
"fontova i kopiranje njih u drugom formatu (Plain text, Unicode ili HTML)  u "
"clipboard."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Double clicking on a character in the preview or pressing &Enter; adds it to "
"the bar below the font preview. This feature allows to collect a word or a "
"group of several characters and copy them together to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Dupli klik na slovo u pregledu ili pritiskanje &Enter; dodaje slovo u bar "
"ispod font pregleda. Ova funkcija omogućava da se uzme riječ ili grupu od "
"nekoliko znakova i kopira ih zajedno u clipboard."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use <guimenuitem>Flip Text</guimenuitem> to reverse the order of the chosen "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"Koristite <guimenuitem> Flip Tekst </guimenuitem> da obrnete redoslijed "
"izabranih znakova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default characters are added to the right end of the group or cursor "
"position. With <guimenuitem>Reverse Direction</guimenuitem> you can change "
"this behavior and add characters in the left direction."
msgstr ""
"Po defaultu znakovi se dodaju na desni kraj grupe ili pozicije kursora. Sa "
"<guimenuitem>Reverse Directon </guimenuitem> možete promijeniti takvo "
"ponašanje i dodavati znakove u lijevom pravcu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can browse characters by their category or quickly find a certain "
"character by searching for its name. &kcharselect; displays various "
"information about the selected character. This includes not only the Unicode "
"character name, but also aliases, general notes and cross references to "
"similar characters."
msgstr ""
"Možete pretraživati znakove po njihovim kategorijama ili brzo pronaći "
"određeni karakter sa traženjem njegovog imena. &kcharselect; prikazuje razne "
"informacije o odabranom znaku. To uključuje ne samo Unicode imena znakova, "
"već i pseudonime, opće napomene i cross reference na sličnim znakova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For technical use, different representations of the character are shown. "
"&kcharselect; also contains Unihan data for East Asian characters to display "
"English definitions and different pronunciations."
msgstr ""
"Za tehničku upotrebu, prikazane su različite reprezentacije znakova. "
"&kcharselect; također sadrži Unihan podatke za East Asian znakove za prikaz "
"engleskih definicija i različitih izgovora."
